{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48391","headline":"题李阳冰玉箸篆词 · 舒元舆","name":"题李阳冰玉箸篆词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斯去千年，冰生唐时。\n冰复去矣，後来者谁。\n後千年有人，谁来待之。\n後千年无人，篆止於斯。\n呜呼主人，爲吾宝之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"舒元舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}